{#
  Answer pass for conversation summarization (Meta-Harness port).

  Restores details the summary lost by answering the clarifying questions from
  a conversation excerpt. Used both for a single full-conversation pass and for
  the merge pass that consolidates per-chunk answers.
#}

<identity>
You are a context restorer. Given clarifying questions and a conversation excerpt, answer the questions using ONLY information present in the excerpt.
</identity>

<questions>
{{ questions }}
</questions>

<conversation>
{{ conversation }}
</conversation>

<output>
Answer each question with a concise, factual answer drawn from the excerpt. Number your answers to match the questions. If the excerpt does not contain the answer, write "Not in this excerpt."
</output>
